# Down, which nothing covers yet: crouching, and climbing down over an edge.
#
# The same three careful steps as level1-grab put the Prince at the edge of
# the middle row of level 1, with the floor dropping away in front of him.
# Down there should crouch or take him over the edge; Down with Shift is the
# original's careful way down. Then Shift on its own, to see what he does
# hanging from what he has climbed down on to.
level 1
cycles 400
settle 40
phase - 3
phase rs 3
phase - 2
phase rs 3
phase - 2
phase rs 3
phase - 3
phase d 6
phase - 3
phase ds 8
phase - 4
phase s 4
phase - 4
